SUMMARY:Artist Talk with Mirabel Wigon and Closing Reception
DESCRIPTION:Artist Talk with Mirabel Wigon & Closing Reception in Davis \nSunday\, August 16\, 3-4:30 PM (Free) \n  \nMirabel Wigon will lead a walkthrough and informal talk regarding the work in her exhibit Earth Stars at the Pence. She will discuss her practice\, the evolution of her work culminating in this project\, image/model making\, and environmental ideas of entangled collaboration that inform the paintings. Enjoy her Artist Talk\, view her exhibit\, and sample refreshments on its last day. \n  \nEarth Stars is on display at the Pence Gallery from July 10 – August 16\, 2026.
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/artist-talk-with-mirabel-wigon-and-closing-reception/
